WEBVTT

00:04.130 --> 00:10.595
Over a century ago, beings that
prey on humans suddenly appeared.

00:15.100 --> 00:20.605
Their absolutely overwhelming strength

00:20.814 --> 00:25.068
quickly pushed humanity to
the brink of extinction.

00:29.155 --> 00:35.495
The surviving humans constructed
three walls: Maria, Rose, and Sina,

00:35.704 --> 00:38.790
which brought them a century of peace.

00:38.998 --> 00:40.417
However...

00:41.334 --> 00:49.551
In the year 845, the Colossal Titan
and the Armored Titan suddenly appeared

00:49.759 --> 00:54.347
and destroyed one of humanity's
walls-and everyday life with it.

00:56.266 --> 00:59.185
Humanity abandoned Wall Maria,

00:59.394 --> 01:03.148
lost twenty percent of its population
and one-third of its territory,

01:03.356 --> 01:08.069
and was forced to
retreat behind Wall Rose.

01:10.947 --> 01:18.580
In the year 850, the Colossal
Titan demolished another wall

01:18.788 --> 01:23.001
and allowed the Titans inside once again.

01:23.209 --> 01:24.419
Eren!

01:24.627 --> 01:26.045
Hurry!

01:32.677 --> 01:38.016
The entire populace was
evacuated two hours later.

01:38.224 --> 01:41.394
Not a single person was eaten by a Titan...

01:42.312 --> 01:48.151
...except for the soldiers who fended
them off and died in the line of duty.

01:48.359 --> 01:49.527
Eren.

01:49.736 --> 01:54.157
As long as I have you,
I can do anything.

02:09.297 --> 02:14.135
Unknown are the names
of the flowers that have been trampled

02:14.344 --> 02:19.599
Birds have fallen to the earth
and long for the wind

02:19.808 --> 02:24.687
Prayers won't solve anything

02:24.896 --> 02:30.026
Only the will to fight
can change the here and now!

02:30.235 --> 02:35.323
O pigs who laugh at the resolve
to walk over corpses to move forward

02:35.532 --> 02:37.867
Livestock complacency? False prosperity?

02:38.076 --> 02:40.745
Give us the freedom of dying,
starving wolves!

02:40.954 --> 02:46.125
The humiliation of being caged
is what triggers us to fight back

02:46.334 --> 02:51.422
We hunters slaughter prey
beyond the castle walls,

02:51.631 --> 02:56.636
consumed with surging bloodlust,

02:56.845 --> 03:03.768
as our crimson bows and arrows
pierce scarlet holes into the twilight

03:35.925 --> 03:37.969
Please wait, Captain!

03:38.177 --> 03:39.971
Should the Titans attack,

03:40.179 --> 03:43.224
we supply soldiers won't be able
to hold this position on our own!

03:43.433 --> 03:45.935
Please, Sir! You have to stay here!

03:46.144 --> 03:47.812
Step aside.

03:48.021 --> 03:52.859
I must reorganize the
reinforcements now.

03:53.484 --> 03:56.738
Behind the safety of
the inner gate, you mean?

03:56.946 --> 03:59.282
What the hell are you trying to say?

03:59.490 --> 04:01.326
I'll have you know I'm following regulations!

04:01.534 --> 04:04.954
Obeying established
regulations is a soldier's duty!

04:05.163 --> 04:07.123
B-But, Sir!
If we lose this position...!

04:07.332 --> 04:09.208
Enough of your talk!

04:10.668 --> 04:11.920
Open your mouth again

04:12.128 --> 04:16.257
and I'll be forced to punish
you for treason where you stand!

04:29.312 --> 04:32.690
Why isn't anyone going over the wall?

04:32.899 --> 04:35.401
I'm sure they heard the
bell signaling us to withdraw...

04:50.458 --> 04:53.211
It's all over...

04:53.419 --> 04:55.046
We're done for...

05:04.931 --> 05:06.224
There!

05:06.432 --> 05:09.310
What good is that going to do?

05:18.861 --> 05:21.114
C'mon, Jean! What are we gonna do?!

05:21.322 --> 05:23.741
Ain't anything we can do...

05:23.950 --> 05:26.202
They finally gave the order to withdraw,

05:26.411 --> 05:29.163
but we don't have enough
gas to scale the wall...

05:29.372 --> 05:31.874
We're all gonna die now...

05:32.083 --> 05:34.752
All 'cause of those cowards...

05:34.961 --> 05:36.754
You mean the supply soldiers?!

05:36.963 --> 05:40.008
What's happened to them?!
Were they wiped out?!

05:40.216 --> 05:42.844
Apparently they lost the will to fight.

05:43.052 --> 05:45.221
I can understand the feeling,

05:45.430 --> 05:47.306
but abandoning
their duty to supply us

05:47.515 --> 05:50.101
so they can barricade
themselves inside Headquarters?

05:50.309 --> 05:52.562
And sure enough,
Titans have swarmed the place,

05:52.770 --> 05:54.689
meaning we can't even
get gas for ourselves.

05:54.897 --> 05:56.691
In that case, it's sink or swim!

05:56.899 --> 05:59.402
We'll just have to
take out the Titans there!

05:59.610 --> 06:04.532
Hanging around here's no different!
The Titans will just gather here too!

06:04.741 --> 06:08.703
We'll only use up what little gas we
have left if we keep running aimlessly!

06:08.911 --> 06:12.707
Once we lose our mobility,
we're really done for!

06:12.915 --> 06:16.502
You're actually using
your head for once, Conny.

06:16.711 --> 06:20.673
But do you really think we
have the manpower to pull that off?

06:20.882 --> 06:24.010
Most of the veteran members of
the vanguard have been wiped out.

06:24.218 --> 06:25.303
We're just cadets;

06:25.511 --> 06:29.515
who can possibly take charge of
a suicide mission like that?

06:29.724 --> 06:31.642
Even if someone could,

06:31.851 --> 06:34.729
it's not like we'd stand a chance
against the Titans anyway.

06:34.937 --> 06:40.526
And the supply room's probably got
some that are three or four meters high.

06:40.735 --> 06:45.031
There's no way we could
get anything done in there.

06:45.990 --> 06:48.534
It's hopeless?

06:48.743 --> 06:51.245
What a dull life this was.

06:51.454 --> 06:54.791
If I'd known this would happen,
I would've said something sooner.

06:54.999 --> 06:57.168
Come on, guys! Let's do it!

06:57.376 --> 06:58.503
Get up!

06:58.711 --> 07:02.006
If we all work together,
we're sure to succeed!

07:02.215 --> 07:04.258
I'll take the lead!

07:15.144 --> 07:17.271
Armin! Let's go...!

07:24.320 --> 07:25.321
Reiner.

07:25.530 --> 07:26.405
What now?

07:26.614 --> 07:29.909
Not yet. We have to let them gather first.

07:30.118 --> 07:31.744
It's no use...

07:32.328 --> 07:35.248
However you look at it,
we're not getting out of this city.

07:35.456 --> 07:37.750
We're all dead.

07:37.959 --> 07:41.254
I mean, I'm ready
to die and everything...

07:41.462 --> 07:45.633
It's just... what am I dying for?

07:45.842 --> 07:46.634
Mikasa!

07:46.843 --> 07:48.803
Weren't you with the rearguard?!

07:49.011 --> 07:50.429
Annie!

07:51.055 --> 07:52.932
I understand the gist of the situation.

07:53.141 --> 07:56.102
So I'm sorry for letting
my personal matters interfere...

07:56.310 --> 07:58.437
...but have you seen Eren's squad?

07:58.646 --> 08:01.691
I haven't, but some squads did
make it over the wall...

08:01.899 --> 08:04.569
Actually, we did find Armin over there.

08:06.320 --> 08:07.738
Armin!

08:08.698 --> 08:10.241
Mikasa...

08:10.449 --> 08:14.579
No! I can't bring myself to face her!

08:14.787 --> 08:17.707
All I did was survive for
no good reason...

08:17.915 --> 08:20.126
If I'd known this would happen...

08:20.334 --> 08:23.337
...I would rather have
died with him then instead!

08:25.006 --> 08:25.840
Armin.

08:26.048 --> 08:29.677
You're not hurt, are you?
Are you all right?

08:35.558 --> 08:37.185
Where's Eren?

08:39.520 --> 08:40.938
Armin?

08:52.325 --> 08:53.743
We...

08:55.328 --> 08:58.414
The cadets of Squad 34...

08:58.623 --> 09:00.208
Thomas Wagner...

09:00.416 --> 09:02.335
Nack Tierce...

09:02.543 --> 09:04.879
Milieus Zeremski...

09:05.087 --> 09:07.048
Mina Carolina...

09:07.256 --> 09:09.759
Eren Jaeger...

09:09.967 --> 09:11.552
These five members...

09:11.761 --> 09:14.430
...fulfilled their duties...

09:14.639 --> 09:17.266
...and died valiantly
on the field of battle!

09:20.102 --> 09:21.938
You can't be serious...

09:23.272 --> 09:26.442
So Squad 34 is basically gone...

09:26.651 --> 09:30.780
The same thing'll happen to
us if we try to take the Titans on...

09:30.988 --> 09:33.407
I'm sorry, Mikasa...

09:33.616 --> 09:37.036
It should've been me, not Eren...

09:37.245 --> 09:38.704
I...

09:38.913 --> 09:41.249
...wasn't able to do anything...!

09:41.832 --> 09:43.251
I'm sorry...

09:47.296 --> 09:48.714
Armin.

09:51.968 --> 09:53.427
Calm down.

09:53.636 --> 09:57.723
Now isn't the time to be emotional.

09:58.391 --> 10:00.017
Now get up.

10:01.477 --> 10:02.561
Marco.

10:02.770 --> 10:05.314
If we eliminate the Titans
swarming around HQ,

10:05.523 --> 10:09.026
we can replenish our gas
supplies and get over the wall.

10:09.235 --> 10:10.361
Correct?

10:10.569 --> 10:12.613
Well, yeah...

10:12.822 --> 10:15.449
But even with your help,
there's just too many...

10:15.658 --> 10:16.742
I can handle them.

10:16.951 --> 10:18.369
Huh?!

10:18.786 --> 10:21.163
I'm strong.

10:21.372 --> 10:23.916
Stronger than all of you.

10:24.125 --> 10:25.835
I'm very strong.

10:26.043 --> 10:30.923
As such, I am capable of
annihilating the Titans there!

10:31.132 --> 10:33.801
Even if I have to go it alone.

10:34.468 --> 10:37.179
As for all of you,
you're not only unskilled,

10:37.388 --> 10:40.141
you're also cowards and wimps.

10:40.933 --> 10:42.727
You're a real disappointment.

10:42.935 --> 10:45.479
You can just stay here
and twiddle your thumbs.

10:45.688 --> 10:47.148
Twiddle and watch.

10:47.356 --> 10:50.484
Whoa, Mikasa!
What's gotten into you?!

10:50.693 --> 10:53.487
You're seriously gonna take
on all those Titans by yourself?!

10:53.696 --> 10:55.197
There's no way you can beat them!

10:55.406 --> 10:57.992
If I can't, then I'll die.
It's that simple.

10:58.200 --> 10:58.993
But...

10:59.201 --> 11:00.453
If I win, I'll live.

11:00.661 --> 11:03.622
And the only way to win is to fight!

11:04.290 --> 11:05.708
Hey!

11:10.087 --> 11:13.215
Your way with words
is the real disappointment.

11:13.424 --> 11:16.469
You actually considered
that motivational...

11:16.677 --> 11:19.722
I blame you for this, Eren...!

11:19.930 --> 11:24.101
Hey! Since when were we taught
to let our comrades fight alone?!

11:24.310 --> 11:27.772
Or do you guys want
to end up as actual cowards?!

11:27.980 --> 11:30.441
Never thought I'd hear him say that.

11:36.614 --> 11:41.118
Come on, you cowards,
weaklings, and morons!

11:41.327 --> 11:42.453
Those guys...

11:42.661 --> 11:44.038
Damn it...

11:44.246 --> 11:47.083
All right, let's do it!

11:54.757 --> 11:55.841
Hurry!

11:56.050 --> 11:57.676
Follow Mikasa!

11:57.885 --> 11:59.220
Fight as little as possible!

11:59.428 --> 12:02.014
Get to HQ before you run out of gas!

12:03.140 --> 12:05.518
Man, Mikasa's incredible...

12:05.726 --> 12:08.145
How can she move so fast?!

12:08.354 --> 12:11.273
No! She's using up too much gas!

12:11.482 --> 12:13.651
She's going to run out right away!

12:13.859 --> 12:15.111
Regardless of our skill,

12:15.319 --> 12:18.197
once we lose our mobility
we're completely helpless!

12:25.538 --> 12:28.124
She's not her usual,
composed self at all!

12:28.332 --> 12:30.960
She's trying to distract
herself from her anguish!

12:31.168 --> 12:33.754
It's only a matter of time until she...!

12:38.467 --> 12:39.885
Mikasa!

12:40.094 --> 12:40.970
Damn!

12:41.178 --> 12:42.179
Jean!

12:42.388 --> 12:43.889
You take the lead!

12:44.098 --> 12:45.516
I'll help Armin!

12:45.724 --> 12:47.226
- No, I will too!
- Don't be stupid!

12:47.435 --> 12:48.978
There are still Titans everywhere!

12:49.186 --> 12:51.522
Your skills are needed!

13:04.994 --> 13:06.203
Again...

13:06.829 --> 13:08.747
It's this again...

13:10.374 --> 13:12.793
I've lost my family again...

13:18.591 --> 13:23.012
Do I have to revisit this pain...

13:23.220 --> 13:27.266
...and start all over from here again?

13:47.703 --> 13:51.707
It's no use. We can't
even get near Headquarters.

13:51.916 --> 13:54.919
Unless we're prepared to die...

14:00.090 --> 14:02.510
Crap! He's out of gas!

14:04.136 --> 14:05.554
Stay back!

14:06.222 --> 14:08.265
- Tom! I'll save you!
- No!

14:08.474 --> 14:09.892
It's too late!

14:11.560 --> 14:12.978
Stop!

14:23.489 --> 14:25.449
Why couldn't I stop them...?

14:29.578 --> 14:31.830
Why didn't I stop them?

14:32.039 --> 14:35.709
If I'd made them stop,
this wouldn't have happened...

14:41.173 --> 14:43.259
Am I really cut out for this?

14:44.343 --> 14:47.638
Am I really fit to have
a position of responsibility?!

14:53.435 --> 14:55.062
No!

15:08.492 --> 15:11.412
This world is cruel.

15:11.620 --> 15:12.913
And...

15:13.831 --> 15:15.332
...very beautiful.

15:22.047 --> 15:24.800
It's been a nice life.

15:49.700 --> 15:51.118
Huh?

15:54.872 --> 15:56.290
Why?

15:58.959 --> 16:01.337
I was sure I'd given up...

16:07.885 --> 16:11.805
Why... am I standing up?

16:12.556 --> 16:14.767
Why... am I struggling?

16:23.442 --> 16:25.069
What for?

16:26.737 --> 16:28.155
After all...

16:30.240 --> 16:32.826
There's no point
in living anymore...

16:33.035 --> 16:34.828
So what's driving me?

16:40.167 --> 16:41.585
Fight!

16:41.794 --> 16:44.296
Fight! Fight!

16:45.339 --> 16:46.757
Eren...

16:47.508 --> 16:48.926
Fight!

16:49.593 --> 16:51.387
You have to fight!

16:51.595 --> 16:52.596
Fight!

16:53.055 --> 16:54.682
Fight!

16:57.393 --> 16:59.853
I'm sorry, Eren...

17:00.062 --> 17:02.314
I won't give up anymore...

17:04.942 --> 17:07.611
I'll never give up again...

17:08.612 --> 17:11.031
If I die...

17:11.240 --> 17:14.993
...I'll lose my memories of
you too, on top of everything else.

17:15.202 --> 17:16.412
So...

17:16.620 --> 17:18.414
...I'll do whatever it takes to win!

17:18.622 --> 17:20.666
Whatever it takes to live!

17:37.808 --> 17:39.643
What just happened?!

18:00.414 --> 18:01.832
A Titan...

18:02.916 --> 18:04.543
...is killing...

18:06.420 --> 18:08.255
...another Titan...

18:32.112 --> 18:33.530
Please, Mikasa!

18:33.739 --> 18:35.157
Be all right!

18:39.286 --> 18:40.704
Mikasa!

18:51.256 --> 18:53.717
Mikasa! Are you all right?!

18:53.926 --> 18:55.969
- You two okay?!
- Yeah!

18:56.178 --> 18:58.222
We gotta get out of here!

19:00.974 --> 19:03.644
Crap! Two 15-meter ones!

19:03.852 --> 19:06.814
No, that Titan is...

19:09.566 --> 19:11.193
Huh?!

19:54.319 --> 19:56.363
I-It finished it off?!

19:56.572 --> 19:58.866
It was actually aware of
its weak spot?!

19:59.074 --> 20:00.409
We gotta get out of here!

20:00.617 --> 20:01.869
Before it comes this way!

20:02.077 --> 20:04.997
No, it's not reacting to us.

20:05.205 --> 20:07.833
Any other one
would attack us for sure...

20:08.792 --> 20:11.879
It seemed to grasp the concept
of hand-to-hand combat too.

20:12.087 --> 20:13.589
Just what is it...?

20:13.797 --> 20:16.091
All we can do is chalk it
up as an Abnormal!

20:16.300 --> 20:18.802
We barely know
anything about 'em, after all.

20:19.011 --> 20:20.721
Now let's just hurry to HQ!

20:20.929 --> 20:24.224
Wait! Mikasa's completely out of gas!

20:24.433 --> 20:25.142
Huh?!

20:25.350 --> 20:26.268
Whoa, are you serious?!

20:26.476 --> 20:29.229
Now what are we gonna do?!
We need you!

20:29.438 --> 20:31.106
The answer's obvious!

20:31.315 --> 20:33.692
I don't have much left...

20:33.901 --> 20:35.694
...but hurry and
switch yours with mine!

20:35.903 --> 20:36.862
Armin!

20:37.070 --> 20:38.906
This is our only option!

20:39.323 --> 20:41.867
It'll amount to nothing if I keep it.

20:42.075 --> 20:43.493
Just...

20:43.994 --> 20:46.580
Use it carefully this time.

20:46.788 --> 20:49.124
Everyone's lives are riding on it.

20:50.959 --> 20:56.632
I took charge without any sense
of responsibility for their lives...

20:56.840 --> 21:01.595
For a short time, I had
even thrown away my own life...

21:01.803 --> 21:04.973
All for my own personal reasons.

21:06.183 --> 21:08.352
I'm...

21:08.560 --> 21:10.020
There!

21:10.228 --> 21:14.024
Your mobility gear still works,
and I've given you all my blades.

21:14.232 --> 21:18.695
All I ask is that you
leave me with this one...

21:18.904 --> 21:23.784
I'd rather not get
eaten alive, if I can help it.

21:29.164 --> 21:30.874
N-No way...

21:32.167 --> 21:33.585
Armin.

21:36.004 --> 21:38.632
I'm not leaving you here.

21:48.392 --> 21:50.018
Back there...

21:51.812 --> 21:54.731
...I was completely confused.

21:54.940 --> 22:00.320
I'd never heard of a
Titan killing another Titan before.

22:01.655 --> 22:05.200
But I also felt a
faint glimmer of elation.

22:06.410 --> 22:08.495
Because what I saw...

22:11.248 --> 22:14.751
...looked like the manifestation
of humankind's anger.

22:37.482 --> 22:42.404
Your dreams are where your heart is

22:42.612 --> 22:48.660
They're more fragile than life itself

22:48.869 --> 22:53.331
Over and over you cast them aside,
only to find more

22:53.540 --> 23:00.005
Now, rest in peace

23:00.213 --> 23:11.349
Pounding impulses defile the things we wish for

23:11.558 --> 23:21.610
and the more we forget
the more we remember again

23:21.818 --> 23:27.574
In this beautiful, cruel world

23:27.783 --> 23:32.746
all I can do is ask why we're still alive

23:32.954 --> 23:38.460
Oh, with our strength... and our weakness...

23:38.668 --> 23:44.132
what are we going to protect if there's no sense

23:44.341 --> 23:47.761
to anything anymore?

23:54.684 --> 23:57.104
A Titan that kills other Titans.

23:57.312 --> 24:03.318
The sight of it leaves the 104th Cadet
Corps Class awestruck and breathless.

24:03.527 --> 24:07.781
What ultimately appears
before them, though, is...
